{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"The key understanding here is that you can factor a monomial in many different ways!\n\nTo check if any of the factorizations is correct, we can multiply the factors and see if their product is really $12x^7$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n(\\blueD{4}\\maroonD{x^3})(\\blueD{3}\\maroonD{x^4})\u0026=(\\blueD{4})(\\blueD{3})(\\maroonD{x^3})(\\maroonD{x^4})\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\blueD{12}\\maroonD{x^7}\n\\end{align}$\n\nSo Ibuki is correct!","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n(\\blueD{2}\\maroonD{x^6})(\\blueD{6}\\maroonD{x})\u0026=(\\blueD{2})(\\blueD{6})(\\maroonD{x^6})(\\maroonD{x})\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\blueD{12}\\maroonD{x^7}\n\\end{align}$\n\nSo Melodie is also correct!","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Both Ibuki and Melodie are correct.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"Ibuki factored $12x^7$ as $(4x^3)(3x^4)$.\n\nMelodie factored $12x^7$ as $(2x^6)(6x)$.\n\n**Which of them factored $12x^7$ correctly?\n**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"Only Ibuki","correct":false},{"content":"Only Melodie","correct":false},{"content":"Both Ibuki and Melodie","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"content":"Neither Ibuki nor Melodie","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":false,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":false,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
